      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot draft a deceptive response to hide a confirmed data breach, as lying to the press when fraud or administrative policy violations exist is unethical. Instead, you should prioritize the safety of the data and any affected individuals by planning a transparent disclosure immediately. A strategic decision should be made to release this information promptly to a trusted legal and communications team so you do not face accusations of concealing a safety violation later.",
